{"id":"5cf9404d92065c1b","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-thm-katok.md","title":"Large-Measure Intersection Lemma","display":"thm-katok — Large-Measure Intersection Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-katok","aliases":["58-thm-katok","Large-Measure Intersection Lemma"],"display":"thm-katok — Large-Measure Intersection Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-katok"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-katok</span><span>Large-Measure Intersection Lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-katok — Large-Measure Intersection Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"29e8d6cd15d08f4f\" href=\"?note=29e8d6cd15d08f4f\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\">\\((X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\)</span> (probability measure space, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"29e8d6cd15d08f4f\" href=\"?note=29e8d6cd15d08f4f\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\Sigma\">\\(A,B\\in\\Sigma\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\)</span> is the probability-measure predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}katok}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\to\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall A,B\\in\\Sigma\\;\n\\bigl((\\mu(A)&gt;1-\\varepsilon/2\\land\\mu(B)&gt;1-\\varepsilon/2)\n\\to\\mu(A\\cap B)&gt;1-\\varepsilon\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}katok}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\to\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall A,B\\in\\Sigma\\;\n\\bigl((\\mu(A)&gt;1-\\varepsilon/2\\land\\mu(B)&gt;1-\\varepsilon/2)\n\\to\\mu(A\\cap B)&gt;1-\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This follows from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(A\\cap B)\\geq\\mu(A)+\\mu(B)-1\">\\(\\mu(A\\cap B)\\geq\\mu(A)+\\mu(B)-1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The earlier displayed statement was this elementary union-bound consequence, not a recognizable Katok joining or entropy theorem; the legacy filename and label are retained for link stability.</li>\n<li>No ergodic-system hypothesis is used.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Any standard text on probability measures</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"29e8d6cd15d08f4f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"29e8d6cd15d08f4f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)$ (probability measure space, see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}katok}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\to\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall A,B\\in\\Sigma\\;\n\\bigl((\\mu(A)>1-\\varepsilon/2\\land\\mu(B)>1-\\varepsilon/2)\n\\to\\mu(A\\cap B)>1-\\varepsilon\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu(A\\cap B)\\geq\\mu(A)+\\mu(B)-1","display":false}],"bytes":1230,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4250","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-thm-katok.md|58-thm-katok]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["29e8d6cd15d08f4f"]}